WORK
  The TYGAZEN SDK for the web (the npm package @tygazen/sdk), a software
  development kit for building, claiming and displaying tygazen character
  identities in browser-based games, together with all of its source code,
  the pixel part catalogue and the config-to-options mapping from which its
  characters are assembled, user-interface code, samples, documentation and
  written text (together, "the Work").
  The Work is an implementation of TYGAZEN, the character and avatar system
  recorded at https://github.com/jyswee/tygazen, and the web counterpart of the
  Unity SDK (com.tygazen).

